  "description": "The Christiania Classic is the original family cargo trike. Since 1984, it has been a familiar sight in Copenhagen and far beyond, becoming a true icon of Scandinavian design. While the engineering and technology have evolved with the times, its form remains delightfully close to the original. The Classic has truly earned its name.\n\nSpacious and versatile, this three-wheeled cargo bike has room for kids, dogs, sand toys, and even a picnic basket. Perfect for school drop-offs, grocery runs, library trips, or a sunny day at the beach, it’s designed to make everyday outings simple and joyful.\n\nOne of our favorite features? The kids ride up front in the cargo box, so you can keep an eye on them and keep the conversation going—whether that’s singing, chatting, or laughing together along the ride. It’s an easy, fun way to spend less time in the car and more time outside as a family.",
